    "day": 18,
    "title": "Kaya's School Daydream",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a sunny August morning.",
      "Kaya got out of bed and drank some milk.",
      "She rode her bike, then took the bus to school.",
      "At her desk, Kaya opened her notebook.",
      "Her teacher wrote \"China\" and \"Australia\" with chalk.",
      "Kaya had a question about the blue ocean.",
      "She imagined winter in December and autumn leaves.",
      "She dreamed of playing her guitar in February or a boat trip in January.",
      "She pictured a cute panda with an orange in its mouth.",
      "Her friend, with brown hair, touched her ear."
